  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Major Update: Version 11.0.0 introduces significant enhancements and new features to improve functionality and user experience.\n\t\t- Enhanced Performance: Optimized algorithms for faster upload and download operations.\n\t\t- New Features: Added support for additional Azure Storage features and improved error handling.\n\t\t- Added Support to use Development Storage, ConnectionString, TokenCredential, or Managed Identity for Azure Storage.\n\t\t- Bug Fixes: Resolved several issues reported in the previous version to ensure stability.\n\t\t- Updated NuGet Packages:\n\t\t- Azure.Identity to version 1.21.0\n\t\t- Azure.Storage.Blobs to version 12.27.0\n\t\t- Azure.Storage.Files.Shares to version 12.25.0\n\t\t- Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Abstractions to version 10.0.7\n\t\t- Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection to version 10.0.7\n\t\t- Microsoft.Extensions.Logging to version 10.0.7\n\t\t- Microsoft.Extensions.Options.ConfigurationExtensions to version 10.0.7",
